{"additionalPlain":"The compensation range indicated in this posting reflects the On-Target Earnings (“OTE”) for this role, which includes a base salary and any applicable target bonus amount. This OTE range may vary based on the candidate’s relevant experience, qualifications, and geographic location.  \n \nWhy AHEAD:\n \nThrough our daily work and internal groups like Moving Women AHEAD and RISE AHEAD, we value and benefit from diversity of people, ideas, experience, and everything in between.\n \nWe fuel growth by stacking our office with top-notch technologies in a multi-million-dollar lab, by encouraging cross department training and development, sponsoring certifications and credentials for continued learning.\n \nUSA Employment Benefits include: \n- Medical, Dental, and Vision Insurance \n- 401(k) \n- Paid company holidays \n- Paid time off \n- Paid parental and caregiver leave \n- Plus more! See benefits https://www.aheadbenefits.com/ for additional details. \n \nUse of AI:\nWe may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of the hiring process, such as reviewing applications, analyzing resumes, assessing responses, or to capture recordings and create transcriptions or summaries during interviews. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgment. Final hiring decisions are ultimately made by humans.\n \nIf you would like more information about how your data is processed, please refer to the Candidate Privacy Notice or contact us at privacy@ahead.com. \n \nYou may opt-out of the review or analysis of your application and resume by AI tools by using the General Application. Please include the role you wish to apply for in the Additional Information field. You may also choose to opt-out of recording and transcription at any time, including after joining an interview.  Candidates will not be penalized for choosing to opt-out.\n","additional":"<div><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><em>The compensation range indicated in this posting reflects the On-Target Earnings (“OTE”) for this role, which includes a base salary and any applicable target bonus amount. This OTE range may vary based on the candidate’s relevant experience, qualifications, and geographic location.&nbsp;</em></span><em>&nbsp;</em></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Why AHEAD:</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Through our daily work and internal groups like Moving Women AHEAD and RISE AHEAD, we value and benefit from diversity of people, ideas, experience, and everything in between.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>We fuel growth by stacking our office with top-notch technologies in a multi-million-dollar lab, by encouraging cross department training and development, sponsoring certifications and credentials for continued learning.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">USA Employment Benefits include:&nbsp;</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">- Medical, Dental, and Vision Insurance&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">- 401(k)&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">- Paid company holidays&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">- Paid time off&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">- Paid parental and caregiver leave&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">- Plus more! See benefits </span><a href=\"https://www.aheadbenefits.com/\">https://www.aheadbenefits.com/</a><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> for additional details.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><strong>Use of AI:</strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<div data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of the hiring process, such as reviewing applications, analyzing resumes, assessing responses, or to capture recordings and create transcriptions or summaries during interviews. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgment. Final hiring decisions are ultimately made by humans.</div>\n<div data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>If you would like more information about how your data is processed, please refer to the&nbsp;<a data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" data-linkindex=\"0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://www.ahead.com/upload/us-candidate-privacy-notice.pdf\" title=\"http://www.ahead.com/upload/us-candidate-privacy-notice.pdf\" id=\"OWAbabf1abf-845e-0698-3177-52ee0dbb49b5\">Candidate Privacy Notice</a>&nbsp;or contact us at&nbsp;<a data-linkindex=\"1\" href=\"mailto:privacy@ahead.com\" title=\"mailto:privacy@ahead.com\" id=\"OWA38d1763b-9bca-46c3-8276-f6a88e2966f6\">privacy@ahead.com</a>.&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>You may opt-out of the review or analysis of your application and resume by AI tools by using the&nbsp;<a data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" data-linkindex=\"2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://jobs.lever.co/thinkahead/123c2c15-b0f7-48a0-8f49-c86d99cfdf72\" title=\"https://jobs.lever.co/thinkahead/123c2c15-b0f7-48a0-8f49-c86d99cfdf72\" id=\"OWA088332df-0299-f3c6-4717-c2fbcede3a5a\">General Application</a>. Please include the role you wish to apply for in the Additional Information field. You may also choose to opt-out of recording and transcription at any time, including after joining an interview.&nbsp; Candidates will not be penalized for choosing to opt-out.</div>\n</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full Time","department":"( Security )","location":"United States","team":"Security Delivery","allLocations":["United States"]},"createdAt":1788280080686,"descriptionPlain":"AHEAD builds platforms for digital business. By weaving together advances in cloud infrastructure, automation and analytics, and software delivery, we help enterprises deliver on the promise of digital transformation.\n \nAt AHEAD, we prioritize creating a culture of belonging, where all perspectives and voices are represented, valued, respected, and heard. We create spaces to empower everyone to speak up, make change, and drive the culture at AHEAD. \n \nWe are an equal opportunity employer, and do not discriminate based on an individual's race, national origin, color, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, marital status, or any other protected characteristic under applicable law, whether actual or perceived. \n \nWe embrace all candidates that will contribute to the diversification and enrichment of ideas and perspectives at AHEAD. \n\n\nThe Project Manager is responsible for planning, coordinating, and delivering cybersecurity engagements with a focus on core AHEAD security offerings including identity and data security. This role manages scope, schedule, budget, risks, dependencies, resources, and client communications across security assessments, implementations, migrations, remediation efforts, and managed-service transition activities. The Project Manager partners with engagement leads, architects, engineers, client stakeholders, and partner teams to deliver high-quality outcomes aligned to project plans \n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">AHEAD builds platforms for digital business. By weaving together advances in cloud infrastructure, automation and analytics, and software delivery, we help enterprises deliver on the promise of digital transformation.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">At&nbsp;AHEAD, we prioritize creating a culture of belonging,&nbsp;where all perspectives and voices are represented, valued, respected, and heard. We create spaces to empower everyone to speak up, make change, and drive the culture at AHEAD.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">We are an equal opportunity employer,&nbsp;and&nbsp;do not discriminate&nbsp;based on&nbsp;an individual's race, national origin, color, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, marital&nbsp;status,&nbsp;or any other protected characteristic under applicable law, whether actual or perceived.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em><strong style=\"font-size: 18px;\">We embrace&nbsp;all candidates&nbsp;that&nbsp;will&nbsp;contribute to the diversification and enrichment of ideas and&nbsp;perspectives at&nbsp;AHEAD.&nbsp;</strong></em></div><div><br></div><div><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;e1bcab19-04bf-54cd-b008-56abed355d7f|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,335559740,&quot;240&quot;,201341983,&quot;0&quot;,335559739,&quot;0&quot;,201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469775450,&quot;wnfdnts&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;wnfdnts&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\">The Project Manager&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">is responsible for</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">&nbsp;planning, coordinating, and delivering cybersecurity engagements with a focus on&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">core AHEAD security offerings including&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">identity and data security. This role manages scope, schedule, budget, risks, dependencies, resources, and client communications across security assessments, implementations, migrations, remediation efforts, and managed-service transition activities. The Project Manager partners with engagement&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">leads</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">, architects, engineers, client stakeholders, and partner teams to deliver high-quality outcomes&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">aligned to project plans</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></div>","id":"5b3435a6-71f7-4190-8041-0284aca4a546","lists":[{"text":"Responsibilities ","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;5e5997b6-fa18-5530-af41-1b22580f1876|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Calibri&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;22&quot;,335559740,&quot;240&quot;,201341983,&quot;0&quot;,335559739,&quot;20&quot;,201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469775450,&quot;Bulleted List&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134234082,&quot;true&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;BulletedList&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,335559738,&quot;60&quot;,335559682,&quot;2&quot;,335559683,&quot;0&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;,469777804,&quot;&quot;,469777803,&quot;left&quot;,469777815,&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;,469769242,&quot;8226&quot;,335559685,&quot;720&quot;,335559991,&quot;360&quot;,536884268,&quot;{5e5997b6-fa18-5530-af41-1b22580f1876}{1}&quot;,335552541,&quot;1&quot;]}\">Act as engagement lead on customer engagements</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Communicate&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">project roles and responsibilities to project&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">team members while planning, monitoring, appraising, and reviewing&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">project&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">objectives</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Enforce policies and procedures for each project</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Achieve operational&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">objectives</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;by:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Contributing information and recommendations to strategic plans and reviews</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Preparing and completing action plans</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Implementing production, productivity, quality, and client-service standards</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Resolving problems</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Determining</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;system improvements</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Implementing change</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Meet financial&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">objectives</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;by forecasting requirements, quoting services, scheduling expenditures, analyzing variances, and&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">initiating</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;corrective actions.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Lead delivery of cybersecurity projects in identity, access, and data protection domains, including assessments, design, implementation, migration, remediation, and operationalization efforts.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Update job knowledge by&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">participating</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;in educational opportunities, reading professional publications,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">maintaining</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;personal networks, and participating in professional organizations.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Coordinate project execution across consultants, architects, engineers, customer stakeholders, and partner vendors to ensure&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">delivery</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;quality, milestone attainment, and issue resolution.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Manage RAID logs, project dependencies, change control, decision tracking, and executive status reporting for security engagements.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Drive client governance cadences, including kickoff sessions, status meetings, risk reviews, steering updates, and acceptance/sign</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">-off checkpoints.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Ensure projects follow repeatable delivery standards, documentation requirements, evidence collection expectations, and quality gates.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Partner with technical leads to&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">align</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;delivery plans to security controls, testing, cutover, validation, and post-implementation support needs.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Manage multiple concurrent security engagements and shared resources across pods or workstreams while&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">maintaining</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;schedule and risk governance.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Enhance departmental and organizational reputation by accepting ownership for&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">accomplis</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">hing</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;new and different requests while</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;exploring opportunities to add value to job accomplishments.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Develop budgets and track budget expenses.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"16\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">P</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">rovide performance management feedback</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">for project aligned resources&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">based on project observations</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"17\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Staff projects appropriately and supervise team members.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"18\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Manage team members in a proficient and effective manner</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"19\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Promote process improvement.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"20\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Must pursue professional self-development opportunities on a regular basis.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Requirements ","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;5e5997b6-fa18-5530-af41-1b22580f1876|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Calibri&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;22&quot;,335559740,&quot;240&quot;,201341983,&quot;0&quot;,335559739,&quot;20&quot;,201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469775450,&quot;Bulleted List&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134234082,&quot;true&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;BulletedList&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,335559738,&quot;60&quot;,335559682,&quot;2&quot;,335559683,&quot;0&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;,469777804,&quot;&quot;,469777803,&quot;left&quot;,469777815,&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;,469769242,&quot;8226&quot;,335559685,&quot;720&quot;,335559991,&quot;360&quot;,536884268,&quot;{5e5997b6-fa18-5530-af41-1b22580f1876}{1}&quot;,335552541,&quot;1&quot;]}\">3-5&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">years of</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">prior project management and planning experience.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Possess excellent organizational, presentation, analytical, written, and verbal communication skills.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Strong ability to manage client&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">expectations</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;including in areas of scope, schedule, budget, and satisfaction.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Able to work both independently and in a team-oriented, collaborative environment.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Experience managing cybersecurity, IAM, or data security projects in consulting, professional services, or enterprise IT environments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Working knowledge of security delivery lifecycles, including assessment, design, implementation, testing, remediation, cutover, and transition to operations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Familiarity with&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Cloud</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;security concepts</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">including&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">CNAPP, CWPP,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">and DSPM</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">;&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">and&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">public cloud&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">hypervisors</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">including</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">AWS, Azure,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">and&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">GCP</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Familiarity with identity security concepts such as IAM, IGA, PAM, MFA, SSO, federation, RBAC,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">SoD</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">, service accounts, and&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">secrets</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">&nbsp;management.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Familiarity with data security concepts such as data discovery, classification, labeling, DSPM, DLP, retention, insider risk, and governance.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Ability to manage technical and business stakeholders through security risk, compliance, and control-related decisions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Experience creating executive-ready status reporting, action plans, issue escalations, and customer-facing documentation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Calibri\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Bulleted List\">Preferred: PMP, CSM, ITIL, Security+, CISSP familiarity, or equivalent security/project delivery credentials.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}],"salaryRange":{"min":140000,"max":170000,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-year-salary"},"text":"Project Manager: Security Services","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">AHEAD builds platforms for digital business. By weaving together advances in cloud infrastructure, automation and analytics, and software delivery, we help enterprises deliver on the promise of digital transformation.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">At&nbsp;AHEAD, we prioritize creating a culture of belonging,&nbsp;where all perspectives and voices are represented, valued, respected, and heard. We create spaces to empower everyone to speak up, make change, and drive the culture at AHEAD.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">We are an equal opportunity employer,&nbsp;and&nbsp;do not discriminate&nbsp;based on&nbsp;an individual's race, national origin, color, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, marital&nbsp;status,&nbsp;or any other protected characteristic under applicable law, whether actual or perceived.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em><strong style=\"font-size: 18px;\">We embrace&nbsp;all candidates&nbsp;that&nbsp;will&nbsp;contribute to the diversification and enrichment of ideas and&nbsp;perspectives at&nbsp;AHEAD.&nbsp;</strong></em></div>","openingPlain":"AHEAD builds platforms for digital business. By weaving together advances in cloud infrastructure, automation and analytics, and software delivery, we help enterprises deliver on the promise of digital transformation.\n \nAt AHEAD, we prioritize creating a culture of belonging, where all perspectives and voices are represented, valued, respected, and heard. We create spaces to empower everyone to speak up, make change, and drive the culture at AHEAD. \n \nWe are an equal opportunity employer, and do not discriminate based on an individual's race, national origin, color, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, marital status, or any other protected characteristic under applicable law, whether actual or perceived. \n \nWe embrace all candidates that will contribute to the diversification and enrichment of ideas and perspectives at AHEAD. \n","descriptionBody":"<div><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;e1bcab19-04bf-54cd-b008-56abed355d7f|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,335559740,&quot;240&quot;,201341983,&quot;0&quot;,335559739,&quot;0&quot;,201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469775450,&quot;wnfdnts&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;wnfdnts&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">The Project Manager&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">is responsible for</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">&nbsp;planning, coordinating, and delivering cybersecurity engagements with a focus on&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">core AHEAD security offerings including&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">identity and data security. This role manages scope, schedule, budget, risks, dependencies, resources, and client communications across security assessments, implementations, migrations, remediation efforts, and managed-service transition activities. The Project Manager partners with engagement&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">leads</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">, architects, engineers, client stakeholders, and partner teams to deliver high-quality outcomes&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"wnfdnts\">aligned to project plans</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"The Project Manager is responsible for planning, coordinating, and delivering cybersecurity engagements with a focus on core AHEAD security offerings including identity and data security. This role manages scope, schedule, budget, risks, dependencies, resources, and client communications across security assessments, implementations, migrations, remediation efforts, and managed-service transition activities. The Project Manager partners with engagement leads, architects, engineers, client stakeholders, and partner teams to deliver high-quality outcomes aligned to project plans \n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/thinkahead/5b3435a6-71f7-4190-8041-0284aca4a546","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/thinkahead/5b3435a6-71f7-4190-8041-0284aca4a546/apply"}